      "side": 1,
      "message": "Out of all available UiccCardApplication, there are cases where Modem may report some UiccCardApplication state as READY and others as NOT_READY/DETECTED.\nLike,\n- Modem may not active RUIM/CSIM app if 3GPP2 is not supported\n- Modem may active only one USIM application when card has multiple USIM applications.\n\nIn above situations, with this new change change clients would never get SIM state as LOADED.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 11,
        "endChar": 66
      },
      "revId": "ea3a4caa4fe516faceeaf47da08fad349df7eb5a",
